          "message": {
            "text": "Only the authenticated owner slot is changed after both fresh decoders agree. CSS copies the full computed layer list and substitutes exactly one indexed item, so all unselected image layers survive while repeat/position/size/slice/mask geometry remains in the separately captured computed properties; SVG changes only href.",
            "markdown": "Only the authenticated owner slot is changed after both fresh decoders agree. CSS copies the full computed layer list and substitutes exactly one indexed item, so all unselected image layers survive while repeat/position/size/slice/mask geometry remains in the separately captured computed properties; SVG changes only href."
          },
